画原案","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:230899","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"桜井 光","creatorId":"vndb:s4","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4","name":"桜井 光","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12756","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"理多","creatorId":"vndb:s102","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s102","name":"平井 理子","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12757","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"理多","creatorId":"vndb:s102","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s102","name":"平井 理子","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12758","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"護国卿","creatorId":"vndb:s7792","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7792","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7792","name":"護国卿","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12763","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c23142","characterName":"コニー・イル・リクール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18870","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14033"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9186"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23142"},"originalCharacterName":"コニー・イル・リクール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Part, along with her friend Shela, of the 2-women crew of a small merchant steam-powered airship known as the Ulumensh. She's a trader, member of the 6th class frontier city of Dylas-Leen's Air Guild."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With the aid of her airship she buys, sells, exchange and deliver all sort of stuff between various neighboring locations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Orphan, still emotionally tied to her former orphanage, so much to donate most of her earnings to it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This, until the day she decides to save a mysterious green haired girl from the Empire's Army..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23142"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライアーソフト第１７弾「蒼天のセレナリア」の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛空艇ウルメンシュを操る、空の何でも屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義理堅く情に厚い。幾多のトラブルに巻き込まれながらも、力強く進んでいく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9186","sourceWorkId":"9637","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編主人公の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛空挺「ウルメンシュ」を駆って、相棒のシェラと空の「なんでも屋」を営む少女。元孤児。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明朗快活で女の子らしいしたたかさと、腹黒さを併せ持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛行艇の借金返済、整備費、修理費、孤児院への仕送りなどで常に貧乏。仕事は選ばないが、あくどい仕事はしない主義。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無限に広がる世界を飛び回り、まだ見ぬ世界の風景や人々との出会いを夢見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に理性で動くことを信条としているが、キレると事態が収拾するまで一直線に突っ走り続ける。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9186","sourceWorkId":"16422","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"驾驶飞空艇『ウルメンシュ』、做着天空万用店的少女。原来是孤儿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明亮快活。拥有少女的坚强与坏嘴巴。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为飞空艇的还贷、整备费、修理费、孤儿院的资助，一直都很贫困。虽然不能随意选择工作，但不做违心事是她的信条。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"梦想是踏进无限广阔的世界，遇见各种各样的人和景色。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18870"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e45a9c3951cec3e02d4eb0752e41369d594a15448d37df69000e968bb1e7cf08.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b31dd0513cd642dbc54140b7ca87a1ee9796a9ea34db572865196cf58d1ba353.webp","width":256,"height":232,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野月 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s298","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s298","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s298","name":"野月 まひる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6082","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23143","characterName":"シェラ・マキス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18871","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14033"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9187"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23143"},"originalCharacterName":"シェラ・マキス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Orphan of mysterious origins, Connie took her in as a child and taught her all she knew about airships, she has been with her since."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her past is mostly unknown, but her overall appearance and capabilities makes it clear that she's a member of the heavily persecuted Pucelle specie."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her excellent eyesight and her astounding ability in messing with machines make her an irreplaceable member of the Urmensch's crew."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She's actually princess Shela Rom, descendant princess tied by blood to the first emperor."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23143"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編主人公の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コニーのパートナー。猫目種族であるプーセル人の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"底抜けに明るく元気。精神年齢が低ければ、自主的な社会性も低い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしバカではなく、与えられた仕事はきっちりこなし、以外に優秀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"惚れっぽい。子供っぽい性格からあまりそう見られないが、性にも奔放でエッチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トラブルメーカーになりがちだが、真剣になればそこそこ役立つ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9187","sourceWorkId":"16422","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"与コニー共同驾驶飞空艇『ウルメンシュ』的、细身小个子少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猫目的种族、プセール人。比コニー更要天真和明快。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"精神年龄低，依靠着コニー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对男性相当倾心。用充满爱娇的行动吸引男性。在性方面相当奔放，但因为她平时小孩子般的言行，让别人总是当她是傻瓜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然经常制造麻烦，实际上是个认真做就会做得很好的女孩子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18871"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f2317c990526069b9cef4f8fbb4a4354adbfb0c47a19fc84e7572f1364fe8a5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a78935e61b0404d41331bbbe93955738d4f68cc61c2268d99a6cc2114e2647cf.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金田 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6083","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23290","characterName":"ネーエル・サザン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["9193"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23290"},"originalCharacterName":"ネーエル・サザン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"マタイオスの部下。秘書的な役割をこなしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数少なく、喋るときは重くきつい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"帝国の大貴族であるマタイオスに対してもそうだが、誰に対しても物怖じしない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9193","sourceWorkId":"16422","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09d02599d37b9bce8725d72e6b425a594783d2a9b49ccfa93bc94b9b9e57250a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70066c91cde3c7f1ff266248535d444d4dc64f2b783db4b104951929b4da2ec6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6079","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c48183","characterName":"ニェルレイ","sou